    "GitHub/GitLab 会优先读取 Pages 与构建状态；Netlify 填写 Site ID 和 Token 后会读取最近 Deploy；Vercel、Cloudflare Pages 和自定义平台使用这里的状态端点或站点 URL 做发布后校验。只有开启状态端点授权时，才会向状态端点发送 Bearer Token。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub/GitLab checks Pages and build status first. Netlify reads the latest deploy after you provide a Site ID and token. Vercel, Cloudflare Pages, and custom platforms use the status endpoint or site URL configured here for post-publish verification. A Bearer token is sent only when status endpoint authorization is enabled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub/GitLab 会优先读取 Pages 与构建状态；Netlify 填写 Site ID 和 Token 后会读取最近 Deploy；Vercel、Cloudflare Pages 和自定义平台使用这里的状态端点或站点 URL 做发布后校验。只有开启状态端点授权时，才会向状态端点发送 Bearer Token。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub/GitLab 会优先读取 Pages 与构建状态；Netlify 填写 Site ID 和 Token 后会读取最近 Deploy；Vercel、Cloudflare Pages 和自定义平台使用这里的状态端点或站点 URL 做发布后校验。只有自定义平台的 HTTPS 状态端点可使用 Bearer Token。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub and GitLab prioritize Pages and build status. Netlify reads the latest deploy after a Site ID and token are provided. Vercel, Cloudflare Pages, and custom platforms use the status endpoint or site URL here for post-publish verification. Only a custom platform HTTPS status endpoint can use a Bearer token."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub/GitLab 会优先读取 Pages 与构建状态；Netlify 填写 Site ID 和 Token 后会读取最近 Deploy；Vercel、Cloudflare Pages 和自定义平台使用这里的状态端点或站点 URL 做发布后校验。只有自定义平台的 HTTPS 状态端点可使用 Bearer Token。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
