    "「%@」将保留在回收站中，不会立即删除本地仓库文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"%@\" will remain in the recycle bin, and its local repository file will not be deleted immediately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」将保留在回收站中，不会立即删除本地仓库文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」的回收站副本和版本历史将被删除。仓库待清理记录仍会保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recycle-bin copy and version history for \"%@\" will be deleted. The pending repository cleanup record will remain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的回收站副本和版本历史将被删除。仓库待清理记录仍会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
