    "将从已配置的本地仓库删除 %@。该操作有路径保护和回滚，但仍需你后续检查并提交 Git 变更。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will delete %@ from the configured local repository. The operation includes path protection and rollback, but you must still review and commit the Git change."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将从已配置的本地仓库删除 %@。该操作有路径保护和回滚，但仍需你后续检查并提交 Git 变更。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除「%@」及其 %@ 篇草稿；可在本次会话中通过“撤销删除”恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
